n loop exits without losing it.\n        final CountDownLatch mainLoopDone = new CountDownLatch(1);\n        final ScriptedMockInput scripted = new ScriptedMockInput(commands);\n\n        HeadlessApplicationConfiguration cfg = new HeadlessApplicationConfiguration();\n        // Run as fast as possible (0 = uncapped).\n        cfg.updatesPerSecond = 0;\n\n        // We need to construct HeadlessApplication first so Gdx.files and Gdx.input are\n        // populated. The listener can be a tiny holder that we swap inside create().\n        final AtomicReference<ApplicationListener> swap = new AtomicReference<ApplicationListener>();\n        ApplicationListener bootstrap = new ApplicationListener() {\n            @Override public void create() {\n                FileHandle mapHandle = Gdx.files.absolute(new File(mapPath).getAbsolutePath());\n                FileHandle transcriptHandle = Gdx.files.absolute(new File(transcriptPath).getAbsolutePath());\n                TurnBasedGame game = new TurnBasedGame(mapHandle, transcriptHandle, scripted);\n                swap.set(new LoopTerminator(game, mainLoopDone));\n            }\n            @Override public void render() {\n                ApplicationListener l = swap.get();\n                if (l != null) l.render();\n            }\n            @Override public void pause() {\n                ApplicationListener l = swap.get();\n                if (l != null) l.pause();\n            }\n            @Override public void resize(int w, int h) {\n                ApplicationListener l = swap.get();\n                if (l != null) l.resize(w, h);\n            }\n            @Override public void resume() {\n                ApplicationListener l = swap.get();\n                if (l != null) l.resume();\n            }\n            @Override public void dispose() {\n                ApplicationListener l = swap.get();\n                if (l != null) l.dispose();\n                mainLoopDone.countDown();\n            }\n        };\n\n        HeadlessApplication app = new HeadlessApplication(bootstrap, cfg);\n        // Replace Gdx.input with our scripted subclass immediately after construction.\n        Gdx.input = scripted;\n\n        // Block the main thread until the headless main-loop thread signals done.\n        try {\n            mainLoopDone.await();\n        } catch (InterruptedException ie) {\n            Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static List<String> readCommands(String path) {\n        List<String> out = new ArrayList<String>();\n        java.io.BufferedReader br = null;\n        try {\n            br = new java.io.BufferedReader(\n                    new java.io.InputStreamReader(\n                            new java.io.FileInputStream(path), "UTF-8"));\n            String line;\n            while ((line = br.readLine()) != null) {\n                String trimmed = line.trim();\n                if (trimmed.isEmpty()) continue;\n                if (trimmed.startsWith("#")) continue;\n                out.add(trimmed);\n            }\n        } catch (java.io.IOException ioe) {\n            throw new RuntimeException("Failed to read commands file: " + path, ioe);\n        } finally {\n            if (br != null) {\n                try { br.close(); } catch (java.io.IOException ignored) { }\n            }\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    /** Wraps a listener so we can fire a latch when the headless main loop stops. */\n    private static final class LoopTerminator implements ApplicationListener {\n        private final ApplicationListener delegate;\n        private final CountDownLatch latch;\n        private boolean disposed = false;\n\n        LoopTerminator(ApplicationListener delegate, CountDownLatch latch) {\n            this.delegate = delegate;\n            this.latch = latch;\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        public void create() { delegate.create(); }\n\n        @Override\n        public void render() { delegate.render(); }\n\n        @Override\n        public void pause() { delegate.pause(); }\n\n        @Override\n        public void resize(int width, int height) { delegate.resize(width, height); }\n\n        @Override\n        public void resume() { delegate.resume(); }\n\n        @Override\n        public void dispose() {\n            try {\n                delegate.dispose();\n            } finally {\n                disposed = true;\n                latch.countDown();\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.1 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
